{"title":"Learn To Carve: Labour Day Workshop","startsAt":"2026-10-31T14:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-31T17:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Join us on Halloween from 2:00-5:00 to learn how to hand carve your own spooky wooden firgurine! No experience is needed and all materials are provided. Bring a friend to get a 20$ discount and enjoy a spookily fun time! Register through this link: [https://www.zeffy.com/en-CA/ticketing/learn-to-carve-workshop-halloween ](https://www.zeffy.com/en-CA/ticketing/learn-to-carve-workshop-halloween)","venue":{"name":"GlobalDWS","address":"2, 68 Railside Rd, North York, ON M3A 1A3, Canada, toronto","lat":43.73829,"lng":-79.32303,"city":"toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Craft Hub Toronto: Woodcarving Workshops","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/a/e/a/highres_536286890.jpeg"}